      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "LEXUS LOU (2) impressed in his first outing for Jason Grimson here last week, leading from a wider barrier than this before drawing clear to spank his rivals by close to 35m. Jumps in grade but has the speed to take advantage of the low draw. WICKED WIZARD (8) led and kept going to get home by just over a metre here last start. Draws wider but came from a similar barrier to win in his lone attempt at this distance last month. VAN BASTEN (9) draws wide but his recent consistency at this venue is hard to knock, placing in all three starts since a win last month. There was merit in last week's performance of SWEET STRIKE (7) from a wider draw and he had been racing consistently prior so is worth including.",
